WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:01,720
What happened to the Su family?

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,800
Su Linyu and I were exchanged when we were young

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,600
The Su family recognizes her but not me

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,380
True and false daughter

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,300
Calculated by blood

6
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:12,880
I'm her cousin, I said no

7
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,840
Don't make me say Jiaojiao for the third time, hurry up

8
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:16,800
There's a queue at the canteen

9
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:23,040
This meal is really cheap. What is your bank card number? I can transfer money to you for what purpose?

10
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,720
Maps cost money everywhere

11
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,080
You should know that I will take you shopping for clothes after eating.

12
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,880
How much did you pay four months ago?

13
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:31,880
One billion, I am not short of money

14
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,960
Who are you? What is blue light? Why can you fly?

15
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,720
Qi Xuan is not an ordinary person, right? You can't just let it go.

16
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:40,890
There's nothing you can't say. Sign first.

17
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:44,190
There really is a confidentiality agreement, read it and then sign it

18
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:50,510
Do you know that the place we live in is called Five States and Five States Beyond?
